   2:Source/render/decoders/sgi.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — sgi.c
   3:Source/render/decoders/sgi.c ****  * SGI decoder (see sgi.h). Header is 512 bytes; RLE files carry two 512-entry
   4:Source/render/decoders/sgi.c ****  * big-endian tables (start/length per scanline per channel). Planes are
   5:Source/render/decoders/sgi.c ****  * stored per channel (all rows of R, then G, then B). First-byte-of-row BPC
   6:Source/render/decoders/sgi.c ****  * check (storage flag) plus table sanity used to validate.
   7:Source/render/decoders/sgi.c ****  */
